license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/membrane-heart
abstract: >-
  SYNTHETIC toy. A heart-shaped network of simulated neurons carries a
  travelling phase wave; snapshots are stored in a complex outer-product
  associative memory and a calibrated gate names or refuses a probe.
  Classical, stdlib-only Python. Not a medical model, not a medical
  device, not a diagnosis. No release or DOI has been issued yet.
keywords:
  - associative-memory
  - toy-model
  - synthetic
  - reproducible-research
